      "id": "claim_9a9b801c05094ad896c96e89fdf305d0",
      "statement": "Browser fetch requests abort after 30 seconds. POST error responses may contain a partial order payload via an order property, which the UI surfaces. Network interruptions are treated as unknown outcomes. Tab-scoped sessionStorage under commercelens.checkout.v1 preserves the checkoutAttempt key and payload across refreshes. Starting a new order warns the user that a previous payment may still be pending. Notification service unavailability does not block checkout.",
